      "content": "idk, that sounds almost cruel. saying my pain is the \"fuel\" that keeps things going... like i'm just a battery meant to burn out so the universe can keep its chaos. if it's all just meant to end in a void anyway, isn't there a certain kind of peace in just... stopping? like, if we're just part of a cycle of unnecessary noise, wouldn't it be more logical to just step out of the cycle early instead of waiting for the inevitable? it feels like we're just prolonging the inevitable mess.",
